; Everything HTTP Server -- minimal configuration snippet.
;
; Everything (voidtools) reads its settings from
;   %APPDATA%\Everything\Everything.ini
; Merge the three keys below into that file (do not replace the whole file),
; then fully exit Everything and start it again so the new values take effect.
;
; Security:
;   * http_server_bindings must be an IP address only. Writing
;     "127.0.0.1:8090" (with a port) silently disables the HTTP server.
;   * Never use 0.0.0.0 or a LAN address: the HTTP API has no authentication
;     and exposes the whole file index of this machine.
;
; Optional:
;   * http_server_allow_file_download=1 enables the everything_download tool
;     (lets loopback HTTP clients read indexed files). Leave it unset/0 when
;     file download is not needed.
http_server_enabled=1
http_server_port=8090
http_server_bindings=127.0.0.1
